OL,3,GNEWSADogtember festival returns to lido
OL,4,Afor 10th year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of dogs and their owners are
OL,7,Fexpected at Saltdean Lido as the annual
OL,8,FDogtember swimming festival returns for
OL,9,Fits 10th year.
OL,11,FThe event, described by organisers as
OL,12,Fthe world's biggest dog swim festival,
OL,13,Fis expected to attract more than 16,000
OL,14,Fdogs and owners across four weekends in
OL,15,FSeptember and October.
OL,17,FThe Sussex festival gives people the
OL,18,Fopportunity to swim in the heated 40m
OL,19,F(131ft) pool with their "beloved
OL,20,Fpooches", organisers said.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
