OL,3,GNEWSADogtember festival returns to lido
OL,4,Afor 10th year
OL,5,
OL,6,FDogtember founder Jules Shepherd said:
OL,7,F"This year, our furry friends can enjoy
OL,8,Fall the fun and excitement of Saltdean
OL,9,FLido." She said the festival saw dogs
OL,10,Fof all breeds and sizes having fun and
OL,11,Fmaking friends.
